# Local runtime data of the trading bot — never committed.
#
# The bot writes its trade database, downloaded candles and logs into this
# folder. config.json (the template) and strategies are tracked on purpose;
# everything below is per-deployment state.

user_data/*.sqlite
user_data/*.sqlite-*
user_data/logs/
user_data/data/
user_data/backtest_results/
user_data/hyperopts/
user_data/notebooks/
user_data/freqaimodels/
